quot;; COLOR: #1f497d; mso-ansi-language: LV\">연구자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d; mso-ansi-language: LV\">썸머스쿨 참여자들에게 세 가지 종류의 장학금을 제공합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d\">.:<!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"u5\" /--><u5:p></u5:p></span><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 38pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -18pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-ansi-language: LV; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\">-</font><span style=\"FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d; mso-ansi-language: LV\">라트비아 고등교육기관에서의 교육을 위한 라트비아 장학금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d\"> (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d; mso-ansi-language: LV\">학부생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d\"> 1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d; mso-ansi-language: LV\">학년부터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d; mso-ansi-language: LV\">석사 혹은 박사 과정 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; COLOR: #1f497d\"> / </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; F